  "declienting": [
    "Removed the cross-bucket imports of Breadcrumbs.helpers and Breadcrumbs.types from components/renderings/page-content/breadcrumbs/. A ui primitive reaching into a rendering component is the coupling that stopped this being reusable; the types now live with the component.",
    "Replaced the BreadcrumbBackArrowIcon import with a backIcon slot, and made the separator a slot too.",
    "Replaced the import of textLinkAnimatedUnderline from the sibling text-link component with the shared src/lib/underline module.",
    "Replaced the [data-theme='dark'] selector coupling with an explicit surface prop, so the variant does not depend on an ancestor the component cannot see.",
    "Replaced the hard-coded 44px mobile tap target with the --size-touch-medium token.",
    "Retained the labelled nav landmark, aria-current page text, and default xl switch to a nearest-ancestor back link; the same owned trail and back-link presentations can now be selected independently of viewport."
  ],
